flowchart TD
 A([Start]) --> B[/Read password/]
 B --> C[Initialize character flags]
 C --> D[Check each character]
 D --> E{Length >= 8 and all flags true?}
 E -- Yes --> F[Display Strong]
 E -- No --> G{Length >= 6?}
 G -- Yes --> H[Display Moderate]
 G -- No --> I[Display Weak]
 F --> J([End])
 H --> J
 I --> J
